# Backups install.sh moves aside
*.bak-*

# Editor / LSP scratch
.luarc-local.json
*.swp

# Worktrees. Work happens in one rather than on a branch in the main checkout,
# because the main checkout IS the live config: ~/.config/hypr and the rest are
# links into it, so switching or rebasing there changes the running session
# mid-operation. Claude Code puts its worktrees here.
.claude/worktrees/

# Bytecode from the python-syntax check
__pycache__/

# Credentials and anything else with real values in it. These are the files the
# repo ships as *.example and expects you to COPY to ~/.config rather than have
# symlinked out of here -- so a copy landing in the repo is always a mistake,
# and the remote is public. tests/lint.sh no-secrets is the check that fails a
# commit if one gets added with `git add -f` anyway.
accounts.conf
*.local.conf
host.lua
